    "# Weather Data Pipeline — Exploratory Analysis\n",
    "    **Soraia Pedro Tarrinha · Master's academic project (2021–2022), portfolio revision (2026)**\n",
    "\n",
    "    This notebook works **offline**, using 1,243 historical observations from the original academic project, or with new CSV snapshots generated by the OpenWeather pipeline. No API key is needed for the historical demonstration.\n",
    "\n",
    "    **Data-quality note:** In the original 2021–2022 data, the `Distance` value for Beja is ~1,652 km because the API resolved Beja, Tunisia. The historical measurements are preserved as collected; the modern pipeline explicitly requests `,PT` and validates the country. The historical map uses approximate Portuguese city-centre coordinates only for illustration."
   ]
